      "message": "By default this only creates libraries for the device, but supports enabling them for the host with host_supported: true (and disabling them for the device with device_supported: false, but that\u0027s pretty rare).  The java_library module documentation words this as:\n\njava_library builds and links sources into a `.jar` file for the device, and possibly for the host as well. By default, a java_library has a single variant that produces a `.jar` file containing `.class` files that were compiled against the device bootclasspath. \u003ctrimmed\u003e  Specifying `host_supported: true` will produce two variants, one compiled against the device bootclasspath and one compiled against the host bootclasspath.",
